{"id":8077,"date":"2026-04-18T05:35:45","date_gmt":"2026-04-18T05:35:45","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=8077"},"modified":"2026-08-07T06:24:51","modified_gmt":"2026-08-07T06:24:51","slug":"history-and-evolution-of-digital-marketing","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/history-and-evolution-of-digital-marketing\/","title":{"rendered":"Full History of Digital Marketing (Origin, Evolution, Timeline)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>What comes to mind when you think of marketing? Commercials, ads, and PR stunts, right? It\u2019s easy to forget that marketing is a centuries-old practice.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>From emails to search engines, mobiles to social media, digital ads to <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/content-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">content marketing<\/a>, the digital marketing industry\u2019s evolution hasn\u2019t been boring. It is a strange beast and the rare intersection of technology, human nature, and business. This field has come a long way from the good old days when the cost of eyeballs was measured by primary means to now, where it needs hours of research, hundreds in online advertising costs, and sometimes years of waiting for results that may or may not happen.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>From the internet&#8217;s birth to the dot-com collapse, digital marketing has seen it all. The science and art of selling through the internet have progressed from its early days when searching a market was difficult and seemed like a miracle. It\u2019s moved from being a mysterious craft for digital admen to having a firm place in mainstream business, with virtually every leading brand having some <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-strategy\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing strategy<\/a> in the present world.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>So, let\u2019s turn back the pages of history and embark on a journey through th